#: ../../source/api_WebSocket.md:5
msgid ""
"The WebSocket object provides a way to manage a WebSocket connection to a"
" server, allowing bidirectional communication. The API follows the "
"[WebSocket spec](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/API/WebSocket) and [RFC "
"6455](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6455)."
msgstr ""

